From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:32:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 55/73] Discovery: code pointers in data sections (runs of two
 or more, or a lone pointer at a prologue) and lui/addiu address pairs are
 entry points

FIFA Street's vtables hold leaf functions no JAL reaches (0x3d10d8 starts with lui); an indirect call there hit guest-branch:missing-target. Test: a data word at a prologue and an adjacent run of pointers are registered, an unaligned word is not.

